type: software
title: "pmc-reuse-analysis"
abstract: >
  Mining PubMed Central full-text literature to measure reuse of public
  proteomics datasets deposited in PRIDE. Uses NCBI E-utilities and BioC APIs
  with year-by-year collection to bypass the 9,999-result eSearch cap.
